    "note": "Consumer-local admission gate for the t7/s7 unshadowed POINTOMNI cookie contract. Wave 1 admits exactly the four SPECULAR x IGNORERIM cells and pins each entry's native declarations, constant read-set and exact per-register read-counts. The two native IGNOREROUGHNESS cells compile only: their distinct visibility and rim body is intentionally not reconstructed in this wave. This is an ABI and constant-read claim only, not an execution-equivalence or fidelity claim. No entry is exempt from the read-count check, so the manifest declares no count_exemption_axis. dcl_temps is excluded because it is register allocation, not ABI.",
    "evidence": "The four admitted blobs and two compile-only controls were measured from the AE 1.11.221 archive by the producer. All declare CB12[30] and CB2[15] immediateIndexed, five texture2d SRVs at t0/t1/t2/t3/t7, five mode_default samplers at s0/s1/s2/s3/s7, and the same POSITION14 input plus two MRT outputs. The common reads are CB2 {0:1,1:2,3:3,11:1,12:1,13:1,14:1} and CB12[20..27]:1. SPECULAR adds the second hair lobe and specular paths; IGNORERIM removes only the rim contribution. The source provenance below protects the exact pinned legacy extraction basis and is not an attestation of this sibling's numerical fidelity."
